182	        {ok && (
183	          <div className="rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/10 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-emerald-300">
184	            Subscription created. Add mailboxes below — and, for a domain registered elsewhere, finish
