256	      <div className="mt-2">
257	        <p className="mb-2 text-xs text-slate-300">
258	          We&apos;ll create the MX, SPF, DKIM, DMARC and ownership records for{" "}
259	          <span className="font-mono">{domainName}</span> in your Cloudflare zone — no copying by
